I am back in my room.
The door of the room is closed.
There is a small bathroom in the room.
I go into the bathroom.
I wash my face.
The water is very cold and nice.
I am very tired today.
I am on the bed now.
The ceiling fan is on.
The sound of the fan is loud.
Outside is the city of Mumbai.
It is night, but the city is not quiet.
There is the sound of cars outside.
This city is very big.
I am a little nervous.
But I am excited too.
Now India is my new home.
My new life is here.
